{"id":"ac689c2d93db0966","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous.md","title":"停机概率算子的下半连续性","display":"thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous — 停机概率算子的下半连续性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous","aliases":["43-thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous"],"display":"thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous — 停机概率算子的下半连续性","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-prefix]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Proposition 18.6.1","source_printed_pages":"563","source_pdf_pages":"583","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous — 停机概率算子的下半连续性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Proposition 18.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"563"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"583"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(M\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OraclePF}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{OraclePF}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_M^A\">\\(\\Omega_M^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 带柱集生成的乘积拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall A\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_M^A&gt;r\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(A\\upharpoonright n\\sqsubseteq B\\Rightarrow\\Omega_M^B&gt;r\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall A\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_M^A&gt;r\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(A\\upharpoonright n\\sqsubseteq B\\Rightarrow\\Omega_M^B&gt;r\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无需 M 通用。某个有限阶段已累计超过 r 的停机概率，只依赖有限 oracle 位；这给出每个严格上水平集的开性。该拓扑性质不同于可数域函数的下半可计算性。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Proposition 18.6.1，印刷页 563，PDF 页 583。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{OraclePF}(M)$；$\\Omega_M^A$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。$2^\\omega$ 带柱集生成的乘积拓扑。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{OraclePF}(M)$；$\\Omega_M^A$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。$2^\\omega$ 带柱集生成的乘积拓扑。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OraclePF}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_M^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall A\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_M^A>r\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(A\\upharpoonright n\\sqsubseteq B\\Rightarrow\\Omega_M^B>r\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-472","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-omega-lower-semicontinuous]] — 停机概率算子的下半连续性"}],"outgoing":["0680931785133191","801a9dba9cbba1c7"]}